{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017170415665-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017171045\"/><p>蘋果上月開放預購iPhone18 pro後，1209人報案信用卡疑遭盜用買iPhone，涉款2500萬港元，至今未有人被捕。蘋果昨日(16日)再開放預購摺疊機iPhone Duo，又出現信用卡被盜用的情況。執法部門今午(17日)公布，接獲110人報案指信用卡被盜用買iPhone Duo，涉款460萬港元，涉及多間銀行。部門指，蘋果是次預購仍然沒有啟用3DS(額外認證步驟)。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T09:18:47.109799+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:04:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T09:17:34.306784+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T09:17:34.306784+00:00","content_hash":"037b9a8b5840484cb71fcbc4e7f50669d10f77c83ab9752582378c92bdaf4059","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}